  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PGI Staff and HQ coordination</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will cover staff time, travel- and activity related costs of the NLRC PGI Advisor in support of the NLRC partner countries&apos; work related to Protection, Gender and Inclusion (PGI). It will also cover the costs of a regional PGI workshop. This is a cross-cutting topic of the Partnership between Netherlands Red Cross and the Netherlands Ministry of Foreign Affairs and has an amount of EUR 308.226 available (including top-up in 2023).</narrative>
  </description>
